From 889d02a960574099c309458f031700044be94b72 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lavavex <27239435+lavavex@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 18:22:40 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 05/24] pw_install, pw_prefix: games can share one prefix

pw_install --prefix NAME (or the script's prospero.prefix) installs into
LIBRARY/prefixes/NAME: the first game creates it, later ones install into
it with their create_prefix task skipped, and each profile says
prefix = NAME. Games that look for each other's saves (NFS Carbon and an
NFS Most Wanted save, UG2 and a UG1 save) find them, as on a PC.

pw_prefix follows the profile's prefix: pushing or pulling any game in a
shared prefix syncs LIBRARY/prefixes/NAME with one manifest, .pw/NAME.json.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
